<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Last night started off kinda crappy, but ended up not being too bad.  I logged on with Rak, planning to do some solo'ing at the Crystal Caverns entrance.  After killing a couple miners something seemed wrong.  I was attacking quite slow, but no oracles had slowed me... WTF?!?  I sat down to heal up, and hit inventory to see how much further i had until 33.  Thats when I noticed the problem.  Someone had come and snatched the FBSS I'd been wearing.  I knew who had done it, and he had every right, just caught me off-guard. hehe  (Damn Druids!)  Well, I figured I'll just take it easy, and do the entrace mobs, no big deal.  I went AFK for 5 minutes when my wife got home, came back, and found some other monk had moved in on my spawns.  /sigh  He was 3 levels higher than me, and could have easily gone in deeper, but he refused to.  That pissed me off so I logged on Lownar, figured I'd make some cash since I wouldn't be making any exp.  The stalag terrors werent camped so I moved in and started the farming, errr slaughter.  The terrors were being most kind in their drops, giving up a Crystal Covered Shroud, 3 Froststone Steins (all rotted) a Stalagterror Spine Spear (almost rotted), Chipped Velium Amulet, 6 Black Pearls, 4 Peridots, and over 300pp in cash.  After getting myself quite encumbered, I gated to Kael, cashed out, finished the Engraved Bone Pauldrons quest again, then headed back for more.  On the way down I got an Herbalist Pack, and a Crystalline Belt (? i think thats what it was called, dropped off a ry'gorr inspector).  Made another 150pp then it was time to hook up with nef to borrow the sash again.  He threw a few buffs on me then took off, I soloed the entrance mobs with Rakasak until he dinged 33 plus a little buffer, then logged for the night.  I'd like to continue doing these orcs, but they are a bit difficult at 33.  At 34 it should become easier, but I'm hoping to talk some lowbie friends (31-35ish) into coming into the caverns and having an Orc-a-cue.  So what say you?  Wanna go?<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak Smakatak - 33rd Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Wardak - 7th Level Norseman Warrior<BR>Gawaine Server
